# Copy to .env.local. One project key serves both APIs.
OPENAI_API_KEY=
OPENAI_CHAT_MODEL=gpt-6-luna
OPENAI_EMBEDDING_MODEL=text-embedding-3-small
# Optional local ports and simulator address.
APP_PORT=3000
BANK_PORT=4001
BANK_URL=http://127.0.0.1:4001
# Set BANK_EXTERNAL=1 when BANK_URL is another bank already listening on the local BANK_PORT;
# npm run dev / npm start then do not start the bundled simulator (another host or port skips it too).
# BANK_EXTERNAL=1
# Storage for the app and the bundled bank: DATA_DIR defaults to .data/, BANK_DATA_DIR to DATA_DIR.
# DATA_DIR=.data
# BANK_DATA_DIR=.data
# Per-attempt timeout for bank calls, in ms (positive whole number; ports too, or startup stops). A transfer attempt that times out is retried once
# with the same reference, then verified by reference; a timeout is never reported as a rejection.
BANK_TIMEOUT_MS=1400
# Operator inbox: an open case is "warn" after this many minutes and "breach" after the second
# (positive whole numbers, warn lower than breach, or startup stops).
# CASE_WAIT_WARN_MINUTES=60
# CASE_WAIT_BREACH_MINUTES=240
# Open support cases one customer may hold at a time by asking for a person (positive whole
# number). Past it a request opens no case and points to their most recent open one.
# HANDOFF_OPEN_CASES=5
# Largest accepted JSON request body in bytes; larger bodies get 413 (positive whole number).
# MAX_BODY_BYTES=262144
# Multiplies every per-minute rate limit (whole number); 0 disables them, e.g. 100 for bulk scripts.
# RATE_LIMIT_SCALE=1
# Session cookie lifetime in seconds (positive whole number); older cookies must select a person again.
# SESSION_MAX_AGE_S=43200
# Set COOKIE_SECURE=1 to always mark the session cookie Secure (it already is over HTTPS).
# COOKIE_SECURE=1
# Spend insights: who classifies a movement the rules cannot. auto = System One if DECIDER_API_KEY
# is set, then OpenAI if OPENAI_API_KEY is set; systemone | openai | none force one. With no key at
# all the app still starts and such movements go to "Other · to review". An invalid value below, or
# DECIDER=systemone without a key, stops startup naming the variable. DECIDER=openai without
# OPENAI_API_KEY does not stop startup: no decider runs, and one log line says so
# (`decider_no_openai_key`).
# DECIDER=auto
# System One (Jev) endpoint, key and pinned model. The key is server-only and is sent to this base
# URL alone, which must be https (http only for localhost). Gateways serving the same wire format
# (e.g. https://openrouter.ai/api) work by changing the base URL, key and model id.
# A key the provider rejects (401) switches System One off until the app is restarted: after
# correcting DECIDER_API_KEY, restart. The log line is `decider_auth_failed`.
# DECIDER_BASE_URL=https://api.typesafe.ai
# DECIDER_API_KEY=
# DECIDER_MODEL=jev-1.13.0
# A model answer is shown only at or above this confidence (whole number 1-100): the first for
# System One's confidence, the second for OpenAI's self-reported one.
# DECIDER_THRESHOLD_PCT=80
# DECIDER_OPENAI_THRESHOLD_PCT=85
# Per System One request, in ms (positive whole number); at most three requests per merchant and sign.
# DECIDER_TIMEOUT_MS=10000
# Merchants one customer may send to a decider per rolling 24 hours (positive whole number). Past
# it they go to "Other · to review" (reason decider_budget) until the day has room again.
# DECIDER_DAILY_ITEMS=200
# Product suggestions in the chat: on | off (off = the assistant never suggests a product; another
# value stops startup). At most one suggestion per customer every OFFERS_COOLDOWN_DAYS days (whole
# number; 0 = no cool-down). A product is suggested to a customer at most once in any case.
# OFFERS=on
# OFFERS_COOLDOWN_DAYS=0
# Spending observations ("Worth a look": one fact from the customer's own movements, never
# advice): on | off (off = none in the Overview or the chat; another value stops startup).
# OBSERVATIONS=on
# AI usage trace (operator only, GET /api/usage): one row per model request with its tokens and
# estimated cost: on | off (off = nothing is recorded; another value stops startup).
# AI_USAGE=on
# Prices used for the estimate, to override or add to the built-in ones (src/usage/prices.ts):
# `model=input/cached/output` entries separated by `;`, in US$ per million tokens with at most
# three decimals, `-` for no cached rate. A malformed value stops startup. A model with no price is
# recorded with its tokens and shown as "not priced", never as zero.
# AI_PRICES=gpt-6-luna=0.1/0.01/0.5;jev-1.13=0.042/-/0
# Daily AI spend cap per customer, in US$ (at most nine decimals). Unset = no cap. Once a
# customer's own model requests of the day (Europe/Madrid) reach it, the assistant answers a fixed
# sentence without calling a model and unknown merchants go to "Other · to review" until midnight;
# accounts, transfers, confirmations and human support go on. An invalid value, or a value together
# with AI_USAGE=off, stops startup.
# AI_DAILY_CAP_USD=0.25
# Voice input in the chat (POST /api/transcribe), through OPENAI_API_KEY: on | off (off = no
# microphone; another value stops startup). VOICE_MODEL is the OpenAI transcription model.
# VOICE=on
# VOICE_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini-transcribe
# Development-only defaults; the evaluator supplies its own values.
BANK_SERVICE_SECRET=banana-local-service
BANK_ADMIN_SECRET=banana-local-admin
SESSION_SECRET=banana-local-session
